{"id":"n15701-1-8","stage":2,"title":"마무리 · 完成","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15701-1-8-1","ko":"회의가 거의 끝나 가고 있나요?","zh":"会议快要结束了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회의가","meaning":"会，会议","explanation":"회의：会，会议；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"회의","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73244","senseId":"1","lemma":"회의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회의가","audio":"/audio/dbdde206eab11e8394e7.mp3"}},{"text":"거의","meaning":"几乎，快要","explanation":"거의：几乎，快要","readings":[{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60090","senseId":"2","lemma":"거의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나","audio":"/audio/e62f8593c85c6b2ece03.mp3"}},{"text":"가고","meaning":"到达，迈向","explanation":"가다：到达，迈向；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"9","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가고","audio":"/audio/1fb46b7cd8a51290e6be.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8ada2d6d6aa420fc","term":"회의","zh":"会，会议","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3","entryId":"73244","definition":"许多人聚在一起讨论；或指这种聚会。","pronunciation":["회ː의","훼ː이"]},{